Apple is likely to unveil a new M6 MacBook Pro and refreshed iMacs in October, based on its typical release schedule, according to <em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/01/imac-pink.jpeg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-986822" /><br/>
